{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Inserts the built-in JS humanizer at slot 1 on the selected track\u8217's FX chain.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
