{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Enforces FX chain order on all tracks every second:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab Prioritize midi fx FIRST, in any order amongst themselves\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab VST instruments directly after in order added\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 3.\tx360\tab All other FX: after instruments, in their original order\sa180\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Stops the FX chain window from opening when you copy an FX chain by dragging it between tracks\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Moves selected items to the start of the project, per track. Spacing between items is kept!\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
