{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Duplicates selected track (and children if it's a folder) as a new version The copy is placed directly above the original, muted, collapsed to a small locked height, and named Track Name v1, v2, and so on Version numbers increment based on existing versions within the same parent folder\par}
}

