{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 graysonsolis-scripts\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 A repo for all my scripts for Reaper, the best DAW out there. The scripts in this repository can all be installed through {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://reapack.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
ReaPack
}}}
, a Reaper extension for installing community-made scripts.\par}
